    "Group IV", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->
     "5a1550e8-a2bd-459f-a809-6db6b1bf0798"], Cell["\<\
Playfair's axiom: through a point not on a line there is exactly one parallel.\
\>", "TableText",ExpressionUUID->"6ead5dce-7b28-4815-8afd-10f3b8de0cbd"]},
   {Cell["      ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->
     "91e1691d-9e3a-43b3-b235-3233edca33ac"], Cell[
