  "}"}]], "Output",
 CellLabel->"Out[1]= ",ExpressionUUID->"99d60ec1-86fc-4608-917f-62f7d9d857d2"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
The level set at distance 1 from a diagonal is eight isolated vertices, so \
through any of them there is no parallel.\
\>", "ExampleText",ExpressionUUID->"8157caa3-a493-49c2-a5ad-c7ae7ce0300b"],

